\n        <button class=\"mobile-menu\" type=\"button\" data-open-sidebar=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button>\n        <div><span>CEO COMMAND CENTER</span><div class=\"page-heading-row\"><h1>经营地图</h1><p class=\"page-intro\" data-page-note=\"\">把业务现状、经营重点和可用资源放在一起看。</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topbar-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"global-search-trigger\" data-open-search=\"\" aria-label=\"打开全站搜索\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#search\"></use></svg><span>搜索</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button>\n        <a class=\"sync-pill sync-pill-link\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/benefits.html\"><i></i><span>查看会员权益</span></a>\n        <a class=\"avatar-button\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html\"><span data-member-initial=\"\">何</span><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"dashboard-content cockpit-content\" data-cockpit=\"map\">\n      <div data-today-three-handoff=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"map-handoff\"><div><span class=\"desk-eyebrow\">TODAY</span><h3>今天要做的事在工作台</h3><p>工作台按优先级列出今天值得处理的几件事；这张地图只说明你走到哪一步，不重复列清单。</p></div><a class=\"desk-link\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/main.html#desk-overview\"><div><strong>回到工作台</strong><small>查看今天要处理的事与本周行动</small></div><span>去工作台 →</span></a></div></div>\n      <div data-onboarding-handoff=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"map-handoff is-onboarding\"><div><span class=\"desk-eyebrow\">FIRST 7 DAYS</span><h3>入门路径在工作台</h3><p>你已完成 2/7 项入门体验。继续推进请回工作台，那里按顺序列出下一步。</p></div><a class=\"desk-link\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/main.html#desk-onboarding\"><div><strong>回到工作台继续</strong><small>接着完成入门路径的下一步</small></div><span>继续 →</span></a></div></div>\n      <div class=\"desk-welcome\"><div><p class=\"desk-eyebrow\">看清全局，再决定下一步</p><h2>你的生意，走到哪一步了？</h2><p>把商业定位、成长阶段与行动资源放到同一张地图上。</p></div><a class=\"desk-button\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/main.html\">返回我的工作台 ↗</a></div>\n      <!-- PRD §18.1：导航名与内容标题按建议稿统一（商业定位 / 当前阶段 / 优先方向 / 可用资源 / 最近变化），\n           内容标题用「用户会问出口的问题」，比抽象名词更直白。锚点 id 保持不变（外部链接与测试已依赖）。 -->\n      <nav class=\"desk-map-nav\" data-map-nav=\"\" aria-label=\"经营地图五个查看入口\"><a href=\"#map-identity\" data-map-step=\"\" class=\"is-active\" aria-current=\"step\"><span>01</span>商业定位</a><a href=\"#map-position\" data-map-step=\"\"><span>02</span>当前阶段</a><a href=\"#map-focus\" data-map-step=\"\"><span>03</span>优先方向</a><a href=\"#map-resources\" data-map-step=\"\"><span>04</span>可用资源</a><a href=\"#map-progress\" data-map-step=\"\"><span>05</span>最近变化</a></nav>\n      <section id=\"map-identity\" class=\"desk-panel desk-identity-panel desk-map-section-active\"><div class=\"desk-heading\"><div><span class=\"desk-eyebrow\">01 / 我是谁</span><h2>我服务谁，提供什么帮助</h2></div><a class=\"desk-button\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/portrait.html\">进入商业定位 ↗</a></div>\n        <div data-map-identity=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"desk-empty\">你还没有默认商业画像。先写清“我是谁、服务谁、提供什么价值”。</p></div></section>\n      <section id=\"map-position\" class=\"desk-panel desk-map\"><div class=\"desk-heading\"><div><span class=\"desk-eyebrow\">02 / 我在哪里</span><h2>我目前处在哪个阶段</h2></div><a class=\"desk-button\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/journey.html\">进入经营体检 ↗</a></div>\n        <div data-map-position=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"desk-empty\">尚未评估。完成商业体检后，地图会标出你的当前经营位置。</p></div>\n        <div class=\"desk-stage-path\" data-map-path=\"\"><div class=\"desk-stage\"><span>经营阶段</span><div class=\"desk-stage-name-row\"><b class=\"desk-stage-scale\" title=\"0→1（阶段示意，不代表营业额或人数）\">0→1</b><strong>冷启动</strong></div><small>先确认服务谁，以及对方愿意为什么付费</small></div><div class=\"desk-stage\"><span>经营阶段</span><div class=\"desk-stage-name-row\"><b class=\"desk-stage-scale\" title=\"1→10（阶段示意，不代表营业额或人数）\">1→10</b><strong>强增长</strong></div><small>让合适的人更容易找到你，并形成稳定沟通与选择路径</small></div><div class=\"desk-stage\"><span>经营阶段</span><div class=\"desk-stage-name-row\"><b class=\"desk-stage-scale\" title=\"10→100（阶段示意，不代表营业额或人数）\">10→100</b><strong>模式化</strong></div><small>用流程、模板和工具减少重复劳动；不等于必须招团队</small></div><div class=\"desk-stage\"><span>经营阶段</span><div class=\"desk-stage-name-row\"><b class=\"desk-stage-scale\" title=\"100→1000（阶段示意，不代表营业额或人数）\">100+</b><strong>第二曲线</strong></div><small>在现有业务适合的前提下，选择是否探索新产品、合作或服务</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"desk-capability-board\"><div class=\"desk-capability-copy\"><span class=\"desk-eyebrow\">五项经营能力</span><h3>一眼看清强项与需要补齐的地方</h3><p>图形来自最近一次商业体检。越靠外代表当前自评越稳定，不代表营收高低。每张卡下方的变化分是与上一次同类体检比的加减分，并说明这变化代表什么、接下来可以怎么做。点击左侧能力卡或右侧图例，两边会同步高亮。</p><div class=\"desk-scores\" data-map-scores=\"\"><p class=\"desk-empty\">尚无有效能力评分，完成商业体检后显示。</p></div></div><div class=\"desk-radar-card\" data-map-radar=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"desk-empty\">完成一次包含五项能力评分的商业体检后，这里会出现能力图。</p></div></div></section>\n      <section id=\"map-focus\" class=\"desk-panel desk-focus-panel\"><div class=\"desk-heading\"><div><span class=\"desk-eyebrow\">03 / 优先突破什么</span><h2>接下来优先改善什么</h2></div></div>\n        <div class=\"desk-focus-judgment\" data-desk-judgment=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"desk-caption\">以下建议依据你保存的阶段与客户方向。结合实际业务选择即可，不必全部完成。</p></div>\n        <div data-map-focus=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"desk-empty\">先完成商业体检，再生成阶段建议；不会预先替你设定经营目标。</p></div></section>\n      <section id=\"map-resources\" class=\"desk-panel\"><div class=\"desk-heading\"><div><span class=\"desk-eyebrow\">04 / 用什么推进</span><h2>可以用哪些工具和资料</h2></div></div><div class=\"desk-resource-grid\" data-map-resources=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><a class=\"desk-link\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/library.html?section=featured\"><div><strong>经营百宝箱</strong><small>先浏览当前可访问的精选内容</small></div><span>打开 ↗</span></a></div></section>\n      <!-- MAP-07：原「我的经营变化」与下方「经营成果与成长时间线」是两块内容重复的区块，\n           现合入同一个 #map-progress 区：概览在上，完整记录进入成长记录，不再各铺一块。 -->\n      <section id=\"map-progres